s, and genetic counselors. It also provides other pediatric subspecialty care, including pediatric intensivists, pediatric hospitalists, and pediatric surgeons; support services in other areas of hospitals comprising pediatric emergency room, labor and delivery area, and nursery and pediatric departments; a newborn hearing screening program. The company was formerly known as MEDNAX, Inc. and changed its name to Pediatrix Medical Group, Inc. in July 2022. Pediatrix Medical Group, Inc. was founded in 1979 and is based in Sunrise, Florida.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"8060","sic_desc":"Services-Hospitals","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Care Facilities","mcap":2106897408,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"SUNRISE, FL","exchange":"XNYS","fy_end":"1231","cik":893949,"state_inc":"FL","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-10"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-06","q":[{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":506612000.0,"rev_yoy":3.4,"eps":0.26,"eps_yoy":-29.7,"ni":21391000.0,"ni_yoy":-30.4,"nm":4.2,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":496443000.0,"rev_yoy":-3.4,"eps":-1.5,"eps_yoy":-516.7,"ni":-124287000.0,"ni_yoy":-519.1,"nm":-25.0,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-31","rev":495101000.0,"rev_yoy":0.8,"eps":0.05,"eps_yoy":-70.6,"ni":4035000.0,"ni_yoy":-71.6,"nm":0.8,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-06-30","rev":504296000.0,"rev_yoy":0.7,"eps":-1.84,"eps_yoy":-641.2,"ni":-153025000.0,"ni_yoy":-641.1,"nm":-30.3,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-09-30","rev":511158000.0,"rev_yoy":0.9,"eps":0.23,"eps_yoy":-11.5,"ni":19441000.0,"ni_yoy":-9.1,"nm":3.8,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-12-31","rev":502364000.0,"rev_yoy":1.2,"eps":0.37,"eps_yoy":"turned +","ni":30480000.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":6.1,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null